      <lines>
      <chord name="F"/>Christ for the <chord name="Gm"/>world <chord name="C"/>we <chord name="F"/>sing, <chord name="F"/>The <chord name="C"/>world <chord name="F"/>to <chord name="C7"/>Christ <chord name="F"/>we <chord name="C"/>bring,<br/>
