      <chord name="F"/>the world to <chord name="C"/>Christ we bring,<br/>
      <chord name="C"/><chord name="C7"/>with <chord name="F"/><chord name="C"/>fervent <chord name="C7"/><chord name="F"/>prayer;<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>the <chord name="Gm"/>wayward <chord name="C"/>and <chord name="C7"/>the <chord name="F"/>lost,<br/>
