      <chord name="F"/><chord name="Gm"/>Christ <chord name="C"/><chord name="F"/>for <chord name="F"/>the <chord name="C"/><chord name="F"/>world <chord name="C7"/><chord name="F"/>we <chord name="C"/>sing,<br/>
